James, 17 – Stomach Virus
“I had a stomach virus a few months ago and it was honestly one of the worst things I’ve dealt with. It came out of nowhere, like I felt fine at school and then later that night I started feeling really sick. I couldnt keep food down and I just felt really weak and tired. I mostly stayed in my room and tried to sleep it off, but it was hard. My mom kept telling me to drink small sips of water so I wouldnt get dehydrated, and that actually helped a bit. I also had to be careful about washing my hands and not touching stuff around the house too much so no one else got it. It lasted about 2 days but felt longer. After it passed I was just really careful about what I ate for a few days.”

