Aaliyah, 15 – Strep Throat
“When I had strep throat it was really painful, like way worse than just a normal sore throat. It hurt to talk, swallow, and even drink water sometimes. I remember feeling really frustrated because I couldnt really do anything and had to stay home from school. My parents took me to the doctor and I got medicine, which helped after a couple days. I also made sure not to share drinks or food with anyone because I didnt want my family to get sick too. I spent most of my time resting and watching shows because I didnt have energy to do much else. After a few days it started getting better, but it definitely made me more careful about things like germs and sharing stuff.”

